11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">05</span>Intellectual property</a><a href="#links" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">06</span>Links and third-party services</a><a href="#liability" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">07</span>Availability and liability</a><a href="#privacy" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">08</span>Privacy and cookies</a><a href="#changes" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">09</span>Changes to these terms</a><a href="#law" class="tocl" style="display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(86% 0.012 60);"><span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin-right:12px;">10</span>Governing law and jurisdiction</a></div><div style="flex:1 1 520px;max-width:760px;"><div id="who" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">01</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Who we are</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">This website is operated by <strong style="font-weight:600;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);">DSIGNPOINT SC</strong> (“DsignPoint”, “we”, “us”).</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Tax ID (CIF):</strong> J42645499</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Registered address:</strong> Torrevieja, Spain</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;"><strong style="font-weight:600;">Email:</strong> info@dsignpoint.com</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">By using this website you agree to these terms. If you don’t agree with them, please don’t use the site.</p></div><div id="use" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">02</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Using this website</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">You may use the website for lawful purposes only. You agree not to:</p><ul style="margin:0 0 22px;padding-left:22px;"><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;">try to gain unauthorised access to the site, its servers or any connected system;</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;">introduce malware, or interfere with or overload the website;</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;">use bots, scrapers or automated tools to copy or collect content or data from the site;</li><li style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 8px;">send false, misleading or spam enquiries through our forms.</li></ul><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We may block access to anyone who breaks these rules.</p></div><div id="services" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">03</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Our services and enquiries</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">The information on this website describes how DsignPoint works and the kind of support we offer. It is not a binding offer, quote or contract.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Our work for clients is always agreed separately, in a written proposal and service agreement that sets out the scope, timeline, fees and conditions. Those documents apply to the project instead of this page whenever they differ.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">The discovery call is free and carries no obligation. Booking requests are subject to our confirmation, and we may decline, reschedule or cancel a call when necessary.</p></div><div id="cases" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">04</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Case studies and results</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">Case studies and examples show how we worked with specific businesses. They are shared for illustration and with the permission of the clients involved. Every business is different, so past results are not a promise or guarantee of the results you will get.</p></div><div id="ip" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">05</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Intellectual property</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">All the content on this website, including text, design, layouts, images, graphics, logos and the DsignPoint name and brand, belongs to DsignPoint or is used with permission of its owner. Client names, logos and project materials belong to their respective owners.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">You may view and share the website for personal or business-evaluation purposes. You may not copy, reproduce, modify or distribute our content, or use it commercially, without our written permission.</p></div><div id="links" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">06</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Links and third-party services</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">The website may link to other websites and use third-party services, such as Cal.com for booking calls. We don’t control those, and we aren’t responsible for their content, availability or privacy practices. Their own terms apply when you use them.</p></div><div id="liability" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">07</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Availability and liability</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">We take care to keep the website accurate, secure and available, but it is provided “as is”. We can’t guarantee that it will always be free of errors or interruptions, or that the information on it is always complete or up to date.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">To the extent permitted by law, DsignPoint is not liable for indirect or consequential losses arising from the use of, or inability to use, the website. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits any liability that cannot be excluded by law, nor affects the mandatory rights of consumers.</p></div><div id="privacy" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">08</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Privacy and cookies</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">How we handle your personal data and cookies is explained in our <a href="../privacy-policy/" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">Privacy Policy</a>, which forms part of these terms.</p></div><div id="changes" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">09</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Changes to these terms</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">We may update these terms from time to time. The version published on this page, with the date shown at the top, is the one that applies. By continuing to use the website after an update, you accept the new version.</p></div><div id="law" style="padding-top:8px;margin:0 0 clamp(36px,5vw,56px);scroll-margin-top:110px;"><p style="font-family:monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:oklch(52% 0.09 70);margin:0 0 10px;">10</p><h2 style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,36px);line-height:1.1;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 18px;">Governing law and jurisdiction</h2><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 18px;">These terms are governed by Spanish law. Any dispute arising from the use of this website will be submitted to the courts of Torrevieja (Spain), without prejudice to any mandatory rights that consumers may have to bring a claim before the courts of their place of residence.</p><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0 0 0px;">If you have a question or a complaint, please write to us first at <a href="mailto:info@dsignpoint.com" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">info@dsignpoint.com</a>. We’d much rather solve it together.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section style="background:oklch(93% 0.015 60);color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);padding:clamp(40px,6vh,72px) 0;"><div style="width:100%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5vw,56px);"><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;"><div><p style="font-family:'Newsreader Variable','Newsreader',serif;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.15;color:oklch(17% 0.014 30);margin:0 0 8px;">Questions about this page?</p><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(28% 0.02 30);margin:0;">Write to us at <a href="mailto:info@dsignpoint.com" style="color:oklch(33% 0.14 17);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(33% 0.14 17);">info@dsignpoint.com</a> and we’ll answer personally.</p></div><a href="../book-a-call/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;background:oklch(33% 0.14 17);color:oklch(97% 0.012 70);padding:17px 36px;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:500;">Book a call <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
